---
title: D4 PracticeSession
---
%% UML 2.5 state machine. Transition label syntax: trigger [guard] / effect.
%% Source: PracticeSessionStarter, PracticeSessionService, PracticeSessionStateGuard, PracticeResponseService
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> OVERVIEW : / student creates a session
  OVERVIEW --> IN_PROGRESS : begin / set deadline_at
  IN_PROGRESS --> IN_PROGRESS : answer, skip [PENDING items remain]
  IN_PROGRESS --> IN_PROGRESS : save and exit [has progress]
  IN_PROGRESS --> COMPLETED : answer, skip [no PENDING items remain]
  IN_PROGRESS --> DISCARDED : save and exit [no progress]
  IN_PROGRESS --> EXPIRED : any action [now > deadline_at]
  COMPLETED --> [*]
  DISCARDED --> [*]
  EXPIRED --> [*]
  note right of EXPIRED
    Lazy expiry, there is no worker.
    OVERVIEW never expires because deadline_at is not set yet.
  end note
